  (text "Parallel regulators from selected 5 V; shared GND, not galvanic isolation.\nSensor rail includes mux and all bus/reset pull-ups. GPIO11 enables U22; local EN pull-down 10k.\nESP I2C/reset pins: open drain / high-Z, no internal pull-ups while off.\nAP2112 thermal/load and sensor discharge/startup remain unqualified." (at 205.74 130.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "06300324-0017-5b0f-9657-d789a58ab0c2"))
