  (text "J21 PIN ORDER IS PROJECT-DEFINED: verify sample or repin before use.\n6153: ~175 mm, unshielded; built-in independent 5.1k Rd on CC1/CC2.\nNo duplicate Rd on carrier; exposed CC wires unused. No PD / 2 A assumption.\nShielded cable, shell termination and stronger harness remain desired.\nPanel fit, retention, both plug orientations and switching-noise tests pending." (at 20.32 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e19782ed-1ad7-5df5-8866-1fcc6ed8af80"))
