  (text "Raw-host-VBUS qualifier: ~4.05 V nominal, built-in hysteresis.\nIN+ = 1.242 V reference; IN- = raw USB divider.\nVBUS present -> open-drain OUT low -> U23 enabled (S = 0).\nNo host -> OE pull-up disconnects data even with mains power on.\nB variant: fail-safe inputs and high-Z output during POR.\nHardware qualification covers ROM flashing, not just application code." (at 261.62 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fd201778-fccf-5a81-b350-0fcc553ba6ad"))
  (text "NOT A FABRICATION RELEASE: USB current before/after enumeration, suspend, inrush, source transfer, protection/OVP, thermal and EMC validation pending.\nKeep USB on isolated low-voltage side. USBLC6 is an ESD starting point; it does not qualify the complete assembly or mains isolation." (at 20.32 262.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5af1a6f7-1fd9-5741-ae78-bfb9671b3b6c"))
